1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Job search fatigue is searching separate sites, rereading requirements, comparing your experience, and deciding whether another application deserves the next hour.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:31,000
JobPilot starts with one promise: find the roles worth your time. For You narrows the synthetic demo to three focused decisions with concise, transparent reasons.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Job Detail leads with an integer Fit Score, plain-language conclusion, Apply Priority, evidence, attention areas, relevant experience, practical fit, and the original destination.

4
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Application Strategy answers whether to act, why, what to emphasize, what to prepare, and what to clarify. Evidence is translated. Provenance and limitations stay collapsed. Prepared GPT-5.6 never changes the deterministic score.

5
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Evidence remains available on demand. The grouped view separates strong support, partial support, missing evidence, and items needing review without exposing internal identifiers.

6
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Score Proof visualizes the frozen one-hundred-point contract while exact arithmetic remains in the Technical Ledger.

7
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:53,000
The Score Receipt Verifier reproduces hashing, micro-point arithmetic, caps, transfers, evidence checks, and rounding. Hidden adjustments remain zero.

8
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:05,000
JobPilot opens the fictional employer destination deliberately. There is no form, resume transmission, redirect, or automatic submission.

9
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
The tracker is browser-local. Applied is a planning label only; JobPilot never auto-applies.

10
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Gemma 4 12B is the primary local semantic model. Deterministic code calculates every score. GPT-5.6 Sol was prepared through Codex. OpenAI API requests and cost are zero.

11
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Fit Score is not a hiring probability, and no human-study result is claimed without authentic final participants. JobPilot helps people act on roles that fit.
